/*⁣⁠‌‍⁠​​‌​⁠‍⁠‍‌​​​‌‌‍​‌​​⁠⁠⁠​‍‍​‍‌‌​‌‌‌⁠‍‌⁠‍‌​‌‍​‍‍‍⁠​‍​‌‍⁠⁠‍​⁠⁠⁠‌⁣ 仿Reeden-阴天 — nuojiji messaging app theme */

/* 阴天の仿Reeden消息页面 — nuojiji messaging app theme */

/* ============================================
   阴天の仿Reeden消息页面
   ============================================ */

/* 1. 全局背景与核心骨架 */
#messaging-chat-tab,
#messaging-moments-tab,
#messaging-profile-tab,
#messaging-favorites-tab,
.nj-tab-bottom-bar {
    background-color: transparent !important;
    background-image: url('https://imgbed.heliar.top/i/k-nWgZpYn9nzgp-p.jpg') !important;
    background-size: cover !important;
    background-position: center !important;
    background-repeat: repeat-y !important;

    --nj-msg-text: #666666;
    --nj-msg-text-muted: #a0a0a0;
    --nj-msg-text-time: #cccccc;

    --nj-msg-chat-search-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    --nj-msg-chat-search-radius: 20px;
}

/* 2. 顶栏重构 */
.nj-chat-tab-header,
.nj-profile-tab-header,
.nj-moments-header,
.nj-favorites-tab-header {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) !important;
    backdrop-filter: blur(15px) !important;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(15px) !important;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) !important;
    padding-top: calc(10px + var(--nuo-safe-top)) !important; /* 顶部内边距收紧，让内容整体上移 */
    padding-bottom: 8px !important;

    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    justify-content: space-between !important;
    padding-left: 16px !important;
    padding-right: 16px !important;
}

/* 【左侧：返回键】隐藏自带箭头和文字，仅显示 Hanmi，保留点击返回功能 */
.nj-chat-tab-header > *:first-child,
.nj-chat-tab-header-back-btn {
    opacity: 1 !important;
    font-size: 0 !important; /* 隐藏默认文字 */
    color: transparent !important;
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    background: transparent !important;
}

/* 彻底隐藏系统自带的返回箭头 */
.nj-chat-tab-header > *:first-child svg,
.nj-chat-tab-header-back-btn svg,
.nj-chat-tab-header > *:first-child i,
.nj-chat-tab-header-back-btn i {
    display: none !important; 
}

/* 用伪元素显示 Hanmi */
.nj-chat-tab-header > *:first-child::after,
.nj-chat-tab-header-back-btn::after {
    content: "Hanmi" !important;
    font-size: 17px !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    color: #444444 !important;
    display: block !important;
}

/* 【中间：切换账号标题】隐身但保留点击功能 */
.nj-chat-tab-header-title-container {
    flex: 1 !important;
    display: flex !important;
    justify-content: center !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
}

/* 关键修复：仅仅让按钮变透明，保持原有的物理尺寸，这样才能点得到！ */
.nj-chat-tab-header-title-btn {
    opacity: 0 !important; 
}

/* 隐藏右侧默认按钮并替换为 SVG 更多图标 */
.nj-chat-tab-header-action-btn,
